  "next_open_gate": "PowerTwoAffineShiftedResidueSignedPayloadConstructorOrNamedReturn AND PrimeExtractionFromAffineRoughSurvivorsBeyondParity",
  "plain_conclusion": "Iterating 2n+1 to 2^t n+(2^t-1) only changes the fixed 2-adic residue class and the shifted forbidden residue modulo odd primes. The apparent Euler-product gap follows the missing 2-adic density 1-2^{-t}; after normalization, the remaining problem is still prime extraction from rough survivors."
}
